ail\" title=\"Legacy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/GTRA.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230720174219\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/GTRA.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230720174219 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/GTRA.png/revision/latest?cb=20230720174219 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Legacy\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"GTRA.png\" data-image-name=\"GTRA.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.75</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$21,000</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.1.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 17th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i>\"After many months of hard work, the axe was finally completed. Eron named it the \"Tall Refined axe,\" (later mistranslated to Refined Axe) and it was truly a work of art. The axe has a long, slender handle made of the strongest fiberglass, and a blade forged from the rarest steel.\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<p>The Refined Axe is an axe that is sold at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It can be bought for $21,000. While it has no special abilities, it is a powerful axe.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Refined Axe is a tall hatchet with a headpiece made out of steel, using the default legacy metal material for its appearance. The handle is made of wood that has been painted blue, and a rubber grip at the bottom of the handle.\n</p><p>The Refined Axe has a swing power of 0.5, which the second most powerful axe available for purchase.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When first being added, it was advertised as being a limited time item only, being sold for only 2 days with a ridiculous price tag of $80,000. It went off-sale before returning a few days later: this iteration was hidden on a glass stand without its box, and was being sold for approximately $20,000. Later it was stolen by <a href=\"/wiki/Jerry_Junkman\" title=\"Jerry Junkman\">Jerry</a> and taken to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">Jer's Junkyard</a> with another price change to $40,340, only to later be brought back to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. In the first Secret Friday Update, the Refined Axe was boxed once more, and the original boxed version has turned golden. With this, the price changed to $8,450, where it has remained since.</li>\n<li>The Refined Axe is based on a real <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/307284025205194762/1132109810721095770/image.png\">Kobalt axe</a> that Kinder had laying in his garage.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902142014\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion